Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Level 7 Constraints", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"6bb0c60c-90a5-4aa0-8e63-f487ce47364c"],

Cell["\<\
Tabulate the equations at this level and row-reduce the transpose of their \
resolvent coefficient matrix. The pivot columns select independent equations; \
the remaining columns give their linear combinations. Subtract these \
combinations to obtain constraints involving lower-level resolvents.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"3e792357-504c-4d0d-ae58-54f4f58a3024"],

