Cell["Level 2 & 1 Constraints", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"9f8d0589-c2bb-467d-b806-46a2521378fd"],

Cell["\<\
The remaining equations are polynomial in the level 1 and level 2 resolvents. \

Solve for these auxiliaries, impose the remaining correlator constraints, and \
take the common spectral-curve equation.\
